    }
  },
  "markdown": {
    "lint": false,
    "injected": {
      "x-codex": "OpenWork is a self-hosted-only fork. Install the desktop app with `brew install --cask openwork` (macOS) or from GitHub releases. The backend is `openwork-server`: `npm install -g openwork-server` then run it, and open the URL it prints (default http://127.0.0.1:8787). Do not run `npx openwork`; the npm package named `openwork` is a different project. There is no OpenWork Cloud, no account, and no sign-in. There is no OpenWork MCP Gateway endpoint to connect to: to give an agent these tools, run an MCP server you control. Docs: /start-here/get-started, /start-here/self-host."
    }
  },
